#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0130 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "Same subject, different parameters. Same BASE value carries two different BASEC values, but the rows sit in different within=PARAMCD partitions, so nothing fires. Re-noted under M2-P1 / Fix #302, which removed the USUBJID component: PARAMCD is now the WHOLE partition, so this fixture is the only remaining pin of it, and its verdict is unchanged by the ruling."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col BASE    type=Num
col BASEC   type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | SYSBP | 120 | NORMAL
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | DIABP | 120 | LOW
